  "body": "Experience contemporary coastal living in this newly built six-bedroom home, located in Long Bay. Designed to\r\ncombine modern style with practical functionality, this home provides a spacious layout well suited to multi-generational families and everyday living.\r\n\r\nStepping inside from the sheltered entry, you are welcomed into a foyer featuring a double-height void and staircase. There is a separate formal lounge, while the central hallway leads into an open-plan dining and living area. The kitchen is supported by a separate scullery for convenient storage and preparation. Two outdoor decks—including a central courtyard deck—extend directly from the main living and dining spaces, offering practical indoor-outdoor flow.\r\n\r\nDesigned for flexibility, the ground floor includes a master bedroom with its own walk-in wardrobe and ensuite, making it suitable for guests or extended family members. A separate guest toilet, a dedicated laundry room, and a double internal-access garage complete the lower level. Upstairs, the layout comprises three additional master bedrooms—each with a walk-in wardrobe and private ensuite, alongside two further bedrooms served by a main family bathroom. A spacious upstairs family room with access to a balcony provides an additional living area.\r\n\r\nPositioned in Long Bay, the property offers convenient access to local amenities, including Long Bay Beach, regional\r\npark walking tracks, and nearby village cafes. For commuters, motorway links and the Albany Park & Ride station are within driving distance for bus services to the city centre.\r\n\r\nWith six bedrooms, five-and-a-half bathrooms, multiple living zones, and a well-considered separation of spaces, this home offers a functional and modern lifestyle in Long Bay. Don’t miss out, CALL TODAY!",
